                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Exporter.Geneva-1.13.0-alpha.1"&gt;Exporter.Geneva-1.13.0-alpha.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Exporter.Geneva/1.13.0-alpha.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Exporter.Geneva v1.13.0-alpha.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimental&lt;/strong&gt;: Added an option for configuring a custom string size limit in&lt;br&gt;
the MessagePack serializer. The maximum string length, in characters, can be&lt;br&gt;
set using the &lt;code&gt;PrivatePreviewLogMessagePackStringSizeLimit=&amp;lt;CharCount&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;
connection string parameter.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/2813" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/2813/hovercard"&gt;#2813&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add httpUrl for HTTP server spans mapped from multiple attributes.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/2818" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/2818/hovercard"&gt;#2818&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Exporter.Geneva-1.13.0-alpha.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Exporter.Geneva/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
